    desc: "A flowing 6/8 batá toque for Yemayá, oricha of the sea and motherhood; its rolling triple-pulse feel evokes ocean waves and is among the most beloved salutes. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat%C3%A1_drum]",
