    desc: "The Lenten street-processional music of Haiti, propelled by tanbou, bamboo vaksen horns and graj scrapers in a marching tresillo. A rowdy carnival cousin of Vodou ceremonial drumming. [https://zafenou.com/haitian-music-complete-kompa-rara-arts-and-culture/]",
