    desc: "The fast straight-ahead Dominican merengue, accordion-led with the tambora's hand-and-stick figure under a relentless güira sixteenth-note saw. The national dance rhythm of the Dominican Republic. [https://www.barcelo.com/guia-turismo/en/dominican-republic/dominican-republic/things-to-do/merengue-bachata/ ; https://www.numberanalytics.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-merengue-in-music-and-dance]",
