    desc: "The slower, more relaxed 'merengue apambichao' where dancers stay embraced, its tambora syncopation looser than the derecho. A laid-back northern Cibao variant of merengue. [https://www.lumbeat.com/afro-latin-drum-machine/dominican-rhythms.html ; https://www.barcelo.com/guia-turismo/en/dominican-republic/dominican-republic/things-to-do/merengue-bachata/]",
