    desc: "The Indo-Caribbean fusion of dholak-and-dhantal beats with the soca engine, born of Trinidad's Bhojpuri heritage. A whirling sixteenth-note dance rhythm bridging India and the Caribbean. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chutney_music ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Trinidad_and_Tobago]",
