    desc: "Trinidad's Spanish-language Christmas serenading music from Paramin and Lopinot, rooted in Venezuelan aguinaldo with cuatro, maracas and a 6/8 hemiola feel. The festive parranda tradition of the hills. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parang ; https://travelpulse.com/opinions/blog/parang-primer-the-foundations-of-trinidad-and-tobagos-holiday-music-tradition.html]",
