    desc: "The slower, soulful Garifuna song-form sung by male paranderos over acoustic guitar and gentle drums, telling stories of love and struggle. The bluesy, contemplative side of Garifuna music. [https://www.warasadrumschool.com/garifuna-culture/garifuna-music/ ; https://www.travelbelize.org/blog/the-rhythms-of-garifuna-music-in-belize/]",
