    desc: "The most complex of the seven gwoka rhythms, a moderate-tempo incantation groove tied to the 18th-century maroon resistance societies. The intense centerpiece of the Guadeloupean léwòz gathering. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gwo_ka ; https://mulaogwada.com/les-7-rythmes-du-gwoka/]",
