    desc: "The slow, sorrowful gwoka rhythm of heartbreak and the struggle in love, swaying in a heavy compound feel. The most plaintive of the seven Guadeloupean rhythms. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gwo_ka ; https://mulaogwada.com/les-7-rythmes-du-gwoka/]",
