    desc: "The fast, joyous gwoka rhythm of love, fertility and sensuality, the most widely known of the seven with a bouncing duple drive. The crowd-pleasing celebratory groove of gwoka. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gwo_ka ; https://mulaogwada.com/les-7-rythmes-du-gwoka/]",
