    desc: "The drum-set adaptation of samba where the bass drum plays the surdo-derived crossed pattern and the left foot keeps 2 and 4 on the hi-hat. [https://www.libertyparkmusic.com/guide-drum-kit-notation-latin-music-samba/]",
