    genre: "Brazilian", length: 16,
    voices: { bass: [0, 4, 8, 12], snareAccent: [2, 6, 10, 14] },
    desc: "The marching sertão dance of the cangaceiros from the Pernambuco backlands, named for the shuffling 'xa-xa' of sandals, driven by a steady zabumba march. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xaxado]",
