    desc: "The medium-pitched repique has the greatest freedom of the cuerda, weaving syncopated variations and the madera between phrases to generate surprise and variety over the chico and piano. [Rocamora PhD thesis (iie.fing.edu.uy/~rocamora/phdthesis/candombe.html)]",
