    desc: "Peru's national coastal courtship dance from the north, built on the 6/8–3/4 sesquiáltera: guitar and cajón outline the compound-duple 6/8 against a triple-meter 3/4 bass pulse. [Wikipedia 'Marinera'; Smithsonian Folklife Festival 'Marinera Dance']",
