    desc: "The sankirna (9) konnakol gati cell recited Ta-Ka-Dhi-Mi Ta-Ka-Ta-Ki-Ta, a 4+5 grouping forming the standard nine-pulse solkattu phrase used in sankirna nadai. [https://algorithmicpattern.org/patterns-in-konnakol/]",
