    desc: "An expansive merong with the kethuk spaced widely (arang) once per long span, four kenongan per gongan, very sparse kempul and the great gong ageng marking the cycle end. [https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXoypizjW3WknFiJnKLwHCnL72vedxjQkDDP1mXWo6uco/wiki/List_of_gendhing_structures.html]",
