    desc: "One of the oldest palos, an ancestor of the soleá sharing its solemn 12-count with palmas on 3, 6, 8, 10 and 12 and a melismatic ¡ay! refrain. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palo_(flamenco) ; https://richterguitar.com/flamenco-guitar/flamenco-guitar-toques-and-palos/]",
