    desc: "A close sibling of the caña built on the soleá 12-count (accents 3, 6, 8, 10, 12), distinguished by its long melismatic 'ole' passages. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palo_(flamenco) ; https://chromatone.center/theory/rhythm/system/flamenco/]",
