    desc: "The festive Cádiz family (parent of alegrías, romeras, mirabrás) in a bright soleá 12-count with accents on 3, 6, 8, 10 and 12. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palo_(flamenco) ; https://richterguitar.com/flamenco-guitar/flamenco-guitar-toques-and-palos/]",
