    desc: "Soleá por bulería: a mid-tempo bridge between soleá and bulerías keeping the 12-count with accents on 3, 6, 8, 10 and 12 at a lighter, more flowing pace. [https://www.studioflamenco.com/solea-por-bulerias ; https://richterguitar.com/flamenco-guitar/flamenco-guitar-toques-and-palos/]",
