    desc: "90s boom bap: punchy kick on 1 with a syncopated push, hard snare on the backbeat, ghost snare and swung eighth hats. Dusty, sample-chopped and head-nodding. [https://noisegate.com.au/beat-breakdown-90s-style-boom-bap-hip-hop/]",
