    desc: "Mozambique, invented by Pello el Afrokán (Pedro Izquierdo) in Havana c.1963 from comparsa and rumba, with massed bombos, hoe-blades and cowbells in a 3-2 conga feel. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mozambique_(music)] A steady eighth-note hi-hat keeps the time.",
