    desc: "The explosive Bahamian carnival parade music of goatskin goombay drums, cowbells, whistles and brass, with cowbells ringing on the offbeats over a marching kick. The riotous street pulse of Boxing Day and New Year. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_the_Bahamas ; https://www.nassauparadiseisland.com/blog/dance-to-the-music-of-the-junkanoo-carnival] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
