    desc: "A steady work-rhythm of gwoka whose movements mime the grating of cassava into flour, slower than toumblak. The agricultural labour song of Guadeloupe's countryside. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gwo_ka ; https://mulaogwada.com/les-7-rythmes-du-gwoka/] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
