    desc: "The slow, deep gwoka 'creole waltz' in three time, danced to gently mock the planters' European ballroom steps. The graceful ternary rhythm of the seven. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gwo_ka ; https://mulaogwada.com/les-7-rythmes-du-gwoka/] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
