    desc: "The snare-drum caixa lays a constant carpet of sixteenths with accents on the 'e' of each beat, giving samba its swinging forward drive. [https://www.libertyparkmusic.com/guide-drum-kit-notation-latin-music-samba/] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
