    desc: "The thunderous 'turned beat' processional from Recife-Olinda, with interlocking alfaia drums answering the mestre's call and the gonguê bell marking the timeline. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maracatu] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
