    desc: "The 'loose beat' of the Zona da Mata sugarcane region, a frenetic style with rolling tarol/caixa, mineiro and brass behind the spinning caboclo de lança. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maracatu] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
