    desc: "Carlinhos Brown's Bahian style played on the conical hand-drum timbau, blending samba-reggae and Candomblé into a dense, bass-heavy carnival groove. [https://www.kalango.com/en/community/sambapedia/styles/bahia-styles/] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
