    desc: "The instrumental, wordless cueca of northern Chile driven by brass bands, bombo and trumpet, keeping the 6/8-versus-3/4 hemiola of the southern sung cueca. [Wikipedia 'Cueca'; marcachile.cl 'La cueca, espejo de nuestra diversidad cultural'] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
