    desc: "Most-recorded vallenato air, the cheerful paseo in 2/4 with the caja marking accents and the guacharaca scraping its quarter-plus-two-eighths down-down-up pattern. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vallenato] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
