    desc: "Merengue vallenato in lively 6/8 with a regular two-feel and strong Spanish influence; the caja and guacharaca outline the ternary swing under the accordion. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vallenato] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
