    desc: "A 12-matra cycle in six vibhags of 2 (tali-khali-tali-khali-tali-tali). Theka: Dhin Dhin | Dhage Tirakita | Tu Na | Kat Ta | Dhage Tirakita | Dhin Na; tali on 1/5/9/11, khali on 3/7. [https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
