    desc: "A 14-matra dhrupad/dhamar tal in asymmetric vibhags 5+2+3+4, played with open pakhawaj strokes. Theka: Ka Dhi Ta Dhi Ta | Dha Ga | Ti Ta Ti | Ta Dhi Ta Dha; tali on 1/6/11, khali on 8. [https://www.kathakworld.com/tal-2/] The hi-hat rides the offbeats.",
