    desc: "Timba, the aggressive 1990s evolution of songo (NG La Banda, Los Van Van), layering rumba, funk and jazz over a dense rumba-clave-aligned groove with broken anticipated bass. [https://www.timba.com/musicians/changuito] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
