    desc: "A 6/8 batá toque for Oyá, oricha of wind, lightning, storms and the cemetery gates; its gusting triple-pulse phrasing mirrors her tempestuous nature. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat%C3%A1_drum] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
