    desc: "A stately 4/4 batá toque for Obatalá, the calm white-clad oricha of creation, purity and wisdom; played slowly and majestically to honor the father of the orichas. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bat%C3%A1_drum] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
