    desc: "The classic son cubano groove in 2-3 son clave, with the anticipated bass (bajo anticipado) playing the 'and-of-2' and 'and-of-4'. The blueprint of the son sextet and salsa rhythm section. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Son_cubano] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
