    desc: "The campana/sartén bell line of the Havana conga de comparsa, a syncopated steel-pan timeline that locks with the bombo and propels the carnival comparsa forward. [https://www.melodigging.com/genre/conga] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
