    desc: "The undulating 12/8 Rada invocation rhythm for the serpent-spirit Danbala, the manman drum weaving across a seven-stroke ogan bell. Its three-over-four bell is a Haitian signature timeline. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haitian_Vodou_drumming ; https://www.lakoubrooklyn.com/blog/2017/11/22/rhythms-without-end-haitian-vodou-drum-music] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
