    desc: "The fiery, binary New-World Petwo rhythm born on Haitian soil, hot and aggressive with cracking whip-like accents for the volatile Petwo lwa. Its straight 4/4 pulse contrasts the ternary Rada family. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haitian_Vodou_drumming ; https://www.lakoubrooklyn.com/blog/2017/11/22/rhythms-without-end-haitian-vodou-drum-music] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
