    desc: "A slow southern bomba seis from the Ponce region, its name a creole contraction of the French 'le rose' circle dance. A stately 6/8 groove from Puerto Rico's deep south coast. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bomba_(Puerto_Rico)] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
