    desc: "A cuembé sub-style bomba seis with its own distinct buleador ostinato and dancer-led conversation. A regional variant prized in the bomba canon for its lilting binary push. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bomba_(Puerto_Rico)] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
