    desc: "The sacred long-drum (atabales) music of Dominican folk-Catholic saint festivals and cofradías, deeply Afro-Dominican and largely in compound meter. The spiritual ceremonial drumming of the DR. [https://www.barcelo.com/guia-turismo/en/dominican-republic/dominican-republic/things-to-do/merengue-bachata/] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
