    desc: "The bouncy early-1960s Jamaican beat with its choppy guitar skank on the offbeats and a walking bass, born of mento meeting American R&B. The first great Jamaican pop rhythm. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ska ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ska_stroke] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
