    desc: "The slowed-down, soul-tinged 1966 successor to ska, with a relaxed backbeat, sparser bass and the skank still riding the offbeats. The bridge from ska to roots reggae. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reggae ; https://blog.zzounds.com/2018/04/27/foundational-beats-reggae-drums/] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
