    desc: "The classic roots-reggae feel: kick and rim-shot landing together on beat 3 with beat 1 left empty, the skank hats barking on every offbeat. The defining groove of Bob Marley-era reggae. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_drop_rhythm ; https://rhythmnotes.net/reggae-drum-beats/] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
