    desc: "King Tubby and Lee Perry's studio art-form: a spacious one-drop drenched in reverb and tape delay, with instruments dropping in and out and open-hat splashes. Reggae remixed into cavernous soundscape. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reggae ; https://blog.zzounds.com/2018/04/27/foundational-beats-reggae-drums/] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
