    desc: "UK drill: sliding syncopated 808 bass on the offbeats, snare on the backbeat and skippy hats inherited from UK garage at ~140bpm. Dark, sparse and menacing. [https://blog.soundtrap.com/what-is-jersey-drill/] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
