    desc: "Neo-soul / Dilla-style drunk groove: a humanized off-grid kick-snare with rich ghost snares and laid-back hats. Wonky, soulful and deeply pocketed. [https://mysticalankar.com/blogs/blog/programming-hip-hop-rhythms-crafting-drums-that-make-you-move] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
