    desc: "West Coast G-funk: a relaxed boom-bap kick-snare with swung hats and offbeat open hats under whining synth leads. Smooth, funky and cruising at ~90bpm. [https://www.hitproducerstash.com/blog/drum-patterns-cheatsheet-by-genre] A sparse quarter-note hi-hat opens the groove up.",
