    desc: "The grand parade samba of the escolas, a theme-song groove built for thousands of dancers, with surdos marking 2 and 4 and dense syncopated upper percussion. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samba] A mixed hi-hat figure adds lift.",
