    desc: "The two-tone agogô ostinato of ijexá, the sacred bell timeline that underlies afoxé and feeds directly into the accents of samba-reggae. [https://pulsewave.com/2013/09/rhythm-tip-samba-reggae/] A mixed hi-hat figure adds lift.",
