    desc: "The vigorous toque dedicated to Xangô, orixá of thunder and justice, a fast atabaque rhythm whose rolling rum phrases evoke crashing thunder. [https://www.melodigging.com/genre/candomble-music] A mixed hi-hat figure adds lift.",
