    desc: "The Afro-Brazilian Catholic processional of Minas Gerais honoring Our Lady of the Rosary, with caixas and patangome bells marching the crowned-king cortege. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Congado] A mixed hi-hat figure adds lift.",
