    desc: "The earlier Miami-bass-derived funk carioca groove (the '808 Volt mix' break) that founded the genre in 1980s Rio before tamborzão, with electro kick and clap. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Funk_carioca] A mixed hi-hat figure adds lift.",
