    desc: "The Afro-Maranhão circle dance honoring São Benedito, played on three hand drums (tambor grande, meião, crivador) with the navel-bump punga, UNESCO heritage. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tambor_de_crioula] The hi-hat barks open on the upbeats.",
