    desc: "The Bantu-rooted drum-and-dance of the Paraíba Valley played on tambu and candongueiro drums, a riddle-song tradition counted among samba's ancestors. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jongo] The hi-hat barks open on the upbeats.",
