    desc: "The Bahian bloco-afro fusion of samba-reggae with funk and Candomblé, a heavy surdo groove with a backbeat snare championed by groups like Ilê Aiyê. [https://www.kalango.com/en/community/sambapedia/styles/bahia-styles/] The hi-hat barks open on the upbeats.",
