    desc: "The percussive Afro-Bolivian saya of the Yungas, whose interlocking bombos sound a 'double palpitation' over call-and-response song; the rhythmic root of caporales. [Wikipedia 'Music of Bolivia'; guidebolivia.com 'Traditional dances of Bolivia'] The hi-hat barks open on the upbeats.",
