    desc: "The masked 'dance of the devils' that is the emblem of Oruro carnival; brass bands and bombo march a vigorous duple meter staging the battle of good against evil. [Wikipedia 'Music of Bolivia'; guidebolivia.com 'Traditional dances of Bolivia'] The hi-hat barks open on the upbeats.",
