    desc: "An energetic Bolivian dance depicting eastern-lowland jungle tribes, with abrupt leaping steps over a fast, pounding duple bombo drive. [Wikipedia 'Music of Bolivia'; guidebolivia.com 'Traditional dances of Bolivia'] The hi-hat barks open on the upbeats.",
