    desc: "The slow salon pasillo of the northern Andes in 3/4, with a tres-against-dos hemiola felt against the guitar bordón, kin to the Ecuadorian and Venezuelan forms. [walnutcreekband.org 'Folk Music From Ecuador'; ecuadorianmusic.wordpress.com 'Highlands'] The hi-hat barks open on the upbeats.",
